## 5. Typography

**Nothing below 12px on mobile, ever.**

| Role | Range | Class | Weight |
|------|-------|-------|--------|
| Page heading | 18–20px | `text-heading` | `font-bold` |
| Card/section title | 14–16px | `text-subheading` | `font-semibold` |
| Body / primary text | 14–16px | `text-body` | `font-medium` |
| Secondary text | 12–14px | `text-sub` | `font-normal` |
| Button text | 12–14px | `text-button` | `font-medium` |
| Labels / captions | 10–12px | `text-label` | `font-medium` |

### Rules

- Body text: **16px minimum** on touch devices — prevents iOS auto-zoom
- Line height: **1.5** for body, **1.2** for headings
- Truncate long text with `truncate`, never shrink font below the floor
- Use `font-medium` as default weight (better legibility on dark backgrounds)

---

## 6. Spacing

Use the **4px / 8px grid** system. All spacing should be a multiple of 4.

| Context | Range | Token |
|---------|-------|-------|
| Card inner padding | 12–16px | `--space-card` |
| Compact card padding | 8–12px | `--space-card-sm` |
| Between sections | 16–24px | `--space-section` |
| Between cards | 8–12px | `gap-3` / `gap-2` |
| Between tappable items | 4–8px | `gap-2` minimum |
| Page horizontal padding | 16px, @sm:24px | `px-4 @sm:px-6` |

---

## 7. Icons

Always use **Lucide** icons. Size them with tokens:

| Context | Range | Class |
|---------|-------|-------|
| Inside buttons | 14–18px | `w-icon-sm h-icon-sm` |
| Navigation | 20–24px | `w-icon-lg h-icon-lg` |
| Inline with text | 14–16px | `w-icon-sm h-icon-sm` |
| Standalone icon buttons | 16–20px | `w-icon-md h-icon-md` inside `w-icon-btn h-icon-btn` |

