## 8. Buttons

```tsx
// Primary action — full width on mobile
<button className="w-full @sm:w-auto min-h-touch px-6 rounded-xl text-button font-semibold
  bg-primary text-primary-foreground flex items-center justify-center gap-2">
  <Check className="w-icon-sm h-icon-sm" />
  Save
</button>

// Secondary action
<button className="min-h-touch px-4 rounded-xl text-button font-medium
  text-muted-foreground border border-border flex items-center justify-center gap-2
  hover:bg-muted/20">
  <X className="w-icon-sm h-icon-sm" />
  Cancel
</button>

// Icon-only button
<button className="w-icon-btn h-icon-btn rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center
  text-muted-foreground hover:text-foreground hover:bg-muted transition-colors">
  <MoreHorizontal className="w-icon-md h-icon-md" />
</button>
```

---

## 9. Forms

```tsx
<input
  type="text"
  className="w-full h-input px-4 rounded-xl bg-black border border-border
    text-body text-foreground placeholder:text-muted-foreground/50
    focus:outline-none focus:border-ring"
/>

<label className="text-label font-medium text-muted-foreground uppercase tracking-wider">
  Field Name
</label>
```

### Rules

- Input height: **48px on touch**, 36px on desktop (`h-input`)
- Font size: **16px on touch** to prevent iOS zoom
- Always use `type="email"`, `type="tel"`, `type="number"` for correct keyboard
- Full-width inputs on mobile (`w-full`)
- Labels above inputs, never inline on mobile

---

## 10. Responsive Grids — Container Query Patterns

```tsx
// Form fields — 2 columns on medium containers
<div className="grid grid-cols-1 @md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">

// Stat cards — 2 columns default, 4 on large containers
<div className="grid grid-cols-2 @lg:grid-cols-4 gap-3">

// Project grid — scales from 2 to 5 columns
<div className="grid grid-cols-2 @md:grid-cols-3 @lg:grid-cols-4 @xl:grid-cols-5 gap-4">

// Kanban — stacked on small, horizontal on medium+
<div className="flex flex-col @md:flex-row gap-3 @md:overflow-x-auto">
```

---

## 11. Modals & Overlays

- On mobile: **bottom sheet** sliding up from bottom, `rounded-t-2xl`
- On desktop: **centered card** with backdrop, `rounded-2xl`
- Modals use `lg:` viewport breakpoints (they are `fixed`, outside container flow)
- Close button: `w-icon-btn h-icon-btn` in the top-right corner
- Max height: `max-h-[85vh]` to always show some backdrop

```tsx
<div className="fixed inset-0 z-[500] flex items-end lg:items-center justify-center">
  <div className="absolute inset-0 bg-black/60 backdrop-blur-sm" onClick={onClose} />
  <div className="relative w-full lg:w-[480px] max-h-[85vh] bg-background
    border border-border rounded-t-2xl lg:rounded-2xl overflow-hidden flex flex-col"
    style={{ containerType: "inline-size" }}>
    {/* Content inside uses @container queries */}
  </div>
</div>
```

---

## 12. Navigation & PWA

- **Bottom tabs**: always 48px+ height, icon 24px, label 12px
- **Safe areas**: use `env(safe-area-inset-bottom)` for bottom nav padding
- **Height**: use `100dvh` not `100vh` for full-screen layouts
- **Tap feedback**: add `active:scale-95` or `active:opacity-80` to buttons
- **Disable text selection** on interactive elements: `select-none`
- **Theme color**: match `<meta name="theme-color">` with `--background`

---

## 13. Migration Checklist

When updating any component to follow these standards:

- [ ] Replace `text-[9px]`, `text-[10px]`, `text-[11px]`, `text-[12px]` → token classes
- [ ] Replace `w-6 h-6`, `w-7 h-7` icon buttons → `w-icon-btn h-icon-btn`
- [ ] Replace `w-3 h-3`, `w-3.5 h-3.5` icons → `w-icon-sm h-icon-sm`
- [ ] Replace `px-2 py-1.5` tiny buttons → `min-h-touch px-4`
- [ ] Replace `h-8` inputs → `h-input`
- [ ] Replace `md:`, `lg:` grid breakpoints → `@md:`, `@lg:` container queries
- [ ] Add `cq-adapt` to cards/components that appear in varying-width containers
- [ ] Ensure **8px+ gap** between adjacent tappable elements
- [ ] Test on 375px viewport (iPhone SE) — nothing should overflow or be untappable
